{"id":"t6-hafazan","tahap":"T6","nama":"Hafazan (KAFA)","sk":"Hafazan","ikon":"📖","warna":"#7A5AB8","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 6 (melengkapkan Juz 'Amma)","semak":"pending ustaz review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.68","sumber":"Year 6 hafazan surahs (the owner's e-book is pictures only); Quran text from the app's KFGQPC Uthmani data; meanings pending an ustaz's review; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t6-hafazan-1","nama":"Surah 'Abasa","soalan":[{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah 'Abasa mempunyai ______ ayat.","p":["empat puluh dua","empat puluh","empat puluh satu","empat puluh tiga"],"a":"empat puluh dua","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.bd7d00"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah 'Abasa ialah surah ______.","p":["Makkiyyah","Madaniyyah"],"a":"Makkiyyah","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.986301"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Maksud nama Surah 'Abasa ialah ______.","p":["Bermasam muka","Langit terbelah"],"a":"Bermasam muka","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.31f53c"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat pertama Surah 'Abasa ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَـٰتِ غَرْقًا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنشَقَّتْ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ</span>","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.37758c"},{"j":"isi","s":"Surah 'Abasa ialah surah yang ke-80 dalam ______.","bank":["al-Quran","hadis","kitab Taurat","buku cerita"],"a":"al-Quran","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.70369e"},{"j":"bs","s":"Surah 'Abasa ialah surah Makkiyyah.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.2bbcc0"},{"j":"bs","s":"Surah 'Abasa mempunyai empat puluh tiga ayat.","a":"Salah","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.819584"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat terakhir Surah 'Abasa ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّآ أَنذَرْنَـٰكُمْ عَذَابًا قَرِيبًا يَوْمَ يَنظُرُ ٱلْمَرْءُ مَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ ٱلْكَافِرُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى كُنتُ تُرَٰبَۢا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ أَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُونِۭ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ</span>","aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.ff7852"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat yang selepas <span class=\"arab\">عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ</span> ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ</span>","aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.ab8089"},{"j":"susun","s":"Susun ayat Surah 'Abasa.","susunan":["عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ","أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ"],"aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.d6f22a"},{"j":"bs","s":"Kita melayan semua orang dengan adil tanpa mengira kedudukan.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.55647d"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Pengajaran Surah 'Abasa ialah ______.","p":["kita bersyukur dengan makanan yang Allah tumbuhkan","orang yang sombong seperti Firaun akan dibinasakan","hari kebangkitan pasti berlaku","kita berusaha menerima buku amalan dengan tangan kanan"],"a":"kita bersyukur dengan makanan yang Allah tumbuhkan","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.c4ff79"},{"j":"susun","s":"Susun ayat yang terakhir dalam Surah 'Abasa.","susunan":["ضَاحِكَةٌ مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌ","وَوُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَلَيْهَا غَبَرَةٌ","تَرْهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ"],"aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.974472"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat ke-22 Surah 'Abasa ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ</span>","aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-1.3e604a"}]},{"id":"t6-hafazan-2","nama":"Surah An-Nazi'at","soalan":[{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah An-Nazi'at mempunyai ______ ayat.","p":["empat puluh enam","empat puluh empat","empat puluh lima","empat puluh tujuh"],"a":"empat puluh enam","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.a3d3d0"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah An-Nazi'at ialah surah ______.","p":["Makkiyyah","Madaniyyah"],"a":"Makkiyyah","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.ccaf81"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Maksud nama Surah An-Nazi'at ialah ______.","p":["Malaikat yang mencabut nyawa","Berita besar","Langit terbelah"],"a":"Malaikat yang mencabut nyawa","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.38b604"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat pertama Surah An-Nazi'at ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَـٰتِ غَرْقًا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنشَقَّتْ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَـٰتِ غَرْقًا</span>","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.df9926"},{"j":"isi","s":"Surah An-Nazi'at ialah surah yang ke-79 dalam ______.","bank":["al-Quran","hadis","kitab Taurat","buku cerita"],"a":"al-Quran","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.865564"},{"j":"bs","s":"Surah An-Nazi'at ialah surah Makkiyyah.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.8016c1"},{"j":"bs","s":"Surah An-Nazi'at mempunyai empat puluh tujuh ayat.","a":"Salah","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.530353"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat terakhir Surah An-Nazi'at ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">كَأَنَّهُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوٓاْ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَـٰهَا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّآ أَنذَرْنَـٰكُمْ عَذَابًا قَرِيبًا يَوْمَ يَنظُرُ ٱلْمَرْءُ مَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ ٱلْكَافِرُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى كُنتُ تُرَٰبَۢا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ أَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُونِۭ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">كَأَنَّهُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوٓاْ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَـٰهَا</span>","aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.8b74fa"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat yang selepas <span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَـٰتِ غَرْقًا</span> ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰشِطَـٰتِ نَشْطًا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلسَّـٰبِحَـٰتِ سَبْحًا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">فَٱلسَّـٰبِقَـٰتِ سَبْقًا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">فَٱلْمُدَبِّرَٰتِ أَمْرًا</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰشِطَـٰتِ نَشْطًا</span>","aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.2885ea"},{"j":"susun","s":"Susun ayat Surah An-Nazi'at.","susunan":["وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَـٰتِ غَرْقًا","وَٱلنَّـٰشِطَـٰتِ نَشْطًا","وَٱلسَّـٰبِحَـٰتِ سَبْحًا","فَٱلسَّـٰبِقَـٰتِ سَبْقًا","فَٱلْمُدَبِّرَٰتِ أَمْرًا"],"aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.d98c25"},{"j":"bs","s":"Kita takut kepada Allah dan menahan hawa nafsu.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.2b7bff"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Pengajaran Surah An-Nazi'at ialah ______.","p":["orang yang sombong seperti Firaun akan dibinasakan","kita bersyukur dengan makanan yang Allah tumbuhkan","hari kebangkitan pasti berlaku","kita berusaha menerima buku amalan dengan tangan kanan"],"a":"orang yang sombong seperti Firaun akan dibinasakan","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.f14131"},{"j":"susun","s":"Susun ayat yang terakhir dalam Surah An-Nazi'at.","susunan":["فِيمَ أَنتَ مِن ذِكْرَٮٰهَآ","إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ مُنتَهَـٰهَآ","إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُنذِرُ مَن يَخْشَـٰهَا","كَأَنَّهُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوٓاْ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَـٰهَا"],"aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.cdfd96"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat ke-24 Surah An-Nazi'at ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">فَقَالَ أَنَا رَبُّكُمُ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ أَدْبَرَ يَسْعَىٰ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَعِبْرَةً لِّمَن يَخْشَىٰٓ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَـٰتِ غَرْقًا</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">فَقَالَ أَنَا رَبُّكُمُ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ</span>","aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-2.f64a86"}]},{"id":"t6-hafazan-3","nama":"Surah An-Naba'","soalan":[{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah An-Naba' mempunyai ______ ayat.","p":["empat puluh","tiga puluh lapan","tiga puluh sembilan","empat puluh satu"],"a":"empat puluh","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.c8eac9"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah An-Naba' ialah surah ______.","p":["Makkiyyah","Madaniyyah"],"a":"Makkiyyah","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.ac4a7b"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Maksud nama Surah An-Naba' ialah ______.","p":["Berita besar","Bermasam muka","Malaikat yang mencabut nyawa","Langit terbelah"],"a":"Berita besar","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.6875ff"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat pertama Surah An-Naba' ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَـٰتِ غَرْقًا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنشَقَّتْ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ</span>","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.d6adaa"},{"j":"isi","s":"Surah An-Naba' ialah surah yang ke-78 dalam ______.","bank":["al-Quran","hadis","kitab Taurat","buku cerita"],"a":"al-Quran","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.b077ed"},{"j":"bs","s":"Surah An-Naba' ialah surah Makkiyyah.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.90414e"},{"j":"bs","s":"Surah An-Naba' mempunyai empat puluh satu ayat.","a":"Salah","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.301bd8"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat terakhir Surah An-Naba' ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّآ أَنذَرْنَـٰكُمْ عَذَابًا قَرِيبًا يَوْمَ يَنظُرُ ٱلْمَرْءُ مَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ ٱلْكَافِرُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى كُنتُ تُرَٰبَۢا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">كَأَنَّهُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوٓاْ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَـٰهَا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ أَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُونِۭ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّآ أَنذَرْنَـٰكُمْ عَذَابًا قَرِيبًا يَوْمَ يَنظُرُ ٱلْمَرْءُ مَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ ٱلْكَافِرُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى كُنتُ تُرَٰبَۢا</span>","aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.ea0172"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat yang selepas <span class=\"arab\">عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ</span> ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">عَنِ ٱلنَّبَإِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّذِى هُمْ فِيهِ مُخْتَلِفُونَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّا سَيَعْلَمُونَ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَيَعْلَمُونَ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">عَنِ ٱلنَّبَإِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ</span>","aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.f022ac"},{"j":"susun","s":"Susun ayat Surah An-Naba'.","susunan":["عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","عَنِ ٱلنَّبَإِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","ٱلَّذِى هُمْ فِيهِ مُخْتَلِفُونَ","كَلَّا سَيَعْلَمُونَ","ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَيَعْلَمُونَ"],"aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.233aa2"},{"j":"bs","s":"Kita memerhati ciptaan Allah sebagai tanda kekuasaan-Nya.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.7d7f6d"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Pengajaran Surah An-Naba' ialah ______.","p":["hari kebangkitan pasti berlaku","kita bersyukur dengan makanan yang Allah tumbuhkan","orang yang sombong seperti Firaun akan dibinasakan","kita berusaha menerima buku amalan dengan tangan kanan"],"a":"hari kebangkitan pasti berlaku","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.fa29a1"},{"j":"susun","s":"Susun ayat yang terakhir dalam Surah An-Naba'.","susunan":["رَّبِّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ‌ۖ لَا يَمْلِكُونَ مِنْهُ خِطَابًا","يَوْمَ يَقُومُ ٱلرُّوحُ وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ صَفًّا‌ۖ لَّا يَتَكَلَّمُونَ إِلَّا مَنْ أَذِنَ لَهُ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ وَقَالَ صَوَابًا","ذَٰلِكَ ٱلْيَوْمُ ٱلْحَقُّ‌ۖ فَمَن شَآءَ ٱتَّخَذَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِۦ مَـَٔـابًا","إِنَّآ أَنذَرْنَـٰكُمْ عَذَابًا قَرِيبًا يَوْمَ يَنظُرُ ٱلْمَرْءُ مَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ ٱلْكَافِرُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى كُنتُ تُرَٰبَۢا"],"aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.fc1448"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Ayat ke-21 Surah An-Naba' ialah ______.","p":["<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ كَانَتْ مِرْصَادًا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">وَفُتِحَتِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ فَكَانَتْ أَبْوَٰبًا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">لَّـٰبِثِينَ فِيهَآ أَحْقَابًا</span>","<span class=\"arab\">عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ</span>"],"a":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ كَانَتْ مِرْصَادًا</span>","aras":3,"id":"t6-hafazan-3.6ba977"}]},{"id":"t6-hafazan-4","nama":"Ulang kaji hafazan Tahun 6","soalan":[{"j":"padankan","s":"Padankan surah dengan maksud namanya.","pasangan":[["'Abasa","Bermasam muka"],["An-Naba'","Berita besar"],["An-Nazi'at","Malaikat yang mencabut nyawa"],["At-Takwir","Menggulung"]],"aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-4.e1e8e4"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Juz 'Amma ialah juzuk yang ke-______.","p":["30","1","15","29"],"a":"30","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-4.61c848"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah yang pertama dalam Juz 'Amma ialah Surah ______.","p":["An-Naba'","'Abasa","An-Nas","Al-Fatihah"],"a":"An-Naba'","aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-4.367437"},{"j":"mcq","s":"Surah yang menegur Nabi kerana bermasam muka ialah Surah ______.","p":["'Abasa","An-Naba'","An-Nazi'at","At-Tin"],"a":"'Abasa","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-4.0368f7"},{"j":"bs","s":"Surah an-Nazi'at menceritakan Nabi Musa dan Firaun.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-4.26e5ab"},{"j":"bs","s":"Al-Quran ada 20 juzuk.","a":"Salah","aras":1,"id":"t6-hafazan-4.bbd314"},{"j":"susun","s":"Susun surah mengikut nombor surah (kecil ke besar).","susunan":["An-Naba'","An-Nazi'at","'Abasa","At-Takwir"],"aras":2,"id":"t6-hafazan-4.31212b"}]}]}